/**
 * Builds the destination path for the encrypted copy of a pdf file.
 *
 * The "_encrypted" suffix replaces only the trailing ".pdf" extension, and
 * the resulting name is made unique so that a previously encrypted file is
 * never overwritten when the same pdf is encrypted again.
